    Bug 1902283 - Fix extension menu entries to show their icon again. r=Paenglab


    The CSS which hides the icon is applied to `menu` entries and `menuitem`
    entries, but the CSS which shows the icon is only applied to `menuitem`
    entries. This patch tries to fix that.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D213568

diff --git a/mail/themes/shared/mail/contextMenu.css b/mail/themes/shared/mail/contextMenu.css
index f5a49c0f82d..9299114ea24 100644
--- a/mail/themes/shared/mail/contextMenu.css
+++ b/mail/themes/shared/mail/contextMenu.css
@@ -128,7 +128,7 @@ menupopup {
   }

   /* Allways show the extension icons. */
-  &.no-icon-menupopup > menuitem[image^="moz-extension"] > .menu-iconic-left {
+  &.no-icon-menupopup > :is(menu, menuitem)[image^="moz-extension"] > .menu-iconic-left {
     display: flex;
   }
 }
